- libpng 1.6.44: the libpng licence (libpng-2.0.txt)
- zlib 1.3.1: the zlib licence (zlib.txt)
- FreeType 2.13.3: the FreeType License (FreeType-FTL.txt)
- HarfBuzz 10.1.0: the "Old MIT" licence (HarfBuzz-MIT.txt)
